msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_TEST_BUILD_DEPENDS.rst:8
msgid ""
"Enabling this variable previously enabled generation of ``test_prep/<name>`` "
"build targets for tests when using :ref:`Ninja Generators`.  Since CMake "
"4.5, these targets are now enabled by default.  Since CMake 4.5, the :"
"variable:`CMAKE_SKIP_TEST_PREP_TARGETS` may be used to disable generation of "
"these targets."
msgstr ""

